Error [E0856]: Generic module value parameter `items` uses unsupported type `List(Int)`
  --> tests/ui/genmod_disallowed_value_type.jet:1:12
    |
  1 | module bad(items: [Int]) {
    |            ^^^^^
 Why: Value parameters admit only Bool, Int, Char, String, or a fieldless enum
 Fix: Use a Tier-0 value type, or make this an unannotated type parameter
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0856
